    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      392.35,
      286.6,
      483.9
    ],
    "text": "Land Mini\u2019s Ref. No.: LD/05/2007/PC/247. My Ref. No.: MOR/LAN/01/177. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964(Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      502.45,
      286.59,
      619.86
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: An Allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0014 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 254 in Sheet No. 4 in Block No. 7 in the Cadastral Map No. 520211, prepared by the Survey Department, situated in the village called Thelawala in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 549 A of Borupana in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Moratuwa in Colombo District of the Western Province and more fully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.37,
      577.07,
      517.26
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 254 Name of the Land: Kohombagahawatta; Description: Access Road; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Moggonage Wimaladasa Fernando. Total Extent: 0.0014 Hectare. All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at 10.00 a.m. on 30th September 2015 at the Moratuwa Divisional Secretariat and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 23rd September, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      10.020000457763672,
      19.979999542236328
    ]
  },
